<section class="cc-section" id="platform"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="cc-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">ONE CONNECTED PLATFORM</div><h2>The Technology Layer Behind the Clock.</h2><p>CirrusConnect brings connectivity, workforce data and Ultima operations together in one cloud platform.</p></div><div class="cc-platform"><article class="cc-pillar"><span class="num">CONNECT</span><h3>Move Workforce Data</h3><p>Connect the partner platform to the employee interaction point.</p><div class="cc-mini"><span>APIs</span><span>People</span><span>Transactions</span><span>Data Flows</span></div></article><article class="cc-pillar center"><span class="num">MANAGE</span><h3>Operate Ultima</h3><p>Deploy, configure and manage the technology behind the workforce experience.</p><div class="cc-mini"><span>Provision</span><span>Configure</span><span>Applications</span><span>Fleet</span></div></article><article class="cc-pillar"><span class="num">SUPPORT</span><h3>Resolve Remotely</h3><p>See, diagnose and take action without standing in front of the device.</p><div class="cc-mini"><span>Monitor</span><span>Remote Access</span><span>Diagnostics</span><span>Updates</span></div></article></div><div class="cc-statement">Connect. Manage. Support. Scale.</div></div></section>
<section class="cc-section soft"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="cc-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">CONNECTED WORKFORCE DATA</div><h2>Your Platform to the Clock.<br/>And Back Again.</h2><p>CirrusConnect provides the technology layer for workforce data to move between your platform and the Ultima Series.</p></div><div class="cc-dataflow"><div class="cc-node"><div class="zk-eyebrow">WORKFORCE EDGE</div><h3>Ultima + TimeTrack</h3><p>Where employees interact and workforce data begins.</p></div><div class="cc-arrows">↔<small>EDGE</small></div><div class="cc-node core"><div class="zk-eyebrow" style="color:#a9d88e">CLOUD MIDDLEWARE</div><h3>CirrusConnect</h3><p>APIs · Synchronization · Data Management · Device Operations</p></div><div class="cc-arrows">↔<small>DATA</small></div><div class="cc-node"><div class="zk-eyebrow">YOUR SOFTWARE</div><h3>WFM / HCM Platform</h3><p>Your application, workflows and customer experience.</p></div></div><div class="cc-statement">Connect the workforce platform to the point where workforce data begins.</div></div></section>
<section class="cc-section navy"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="cc-remote"><div class="cc-remote-copy"><div class="zk-eyebrow">REMOTE OPERATIONS</div><h2>Be There.<br/>Without Being There.</h2><p>See the device. Control it. Diagnose it. Take action—from anywhere.</p><div class="cc-remote-grid"><div class="cc-remote-item"><strong>SEE IT</strong><span>Live Screen</span></div><div class="cc-remote-item"><strong>CONTROL IT</strong><span>Interactive Access</span></div><div class="cc-remote-item"><strong>DIAGNOSE IT</strong><span>Logs &amp; Health</span></div><div class="cc-remote-item"><strong>FIX IT</strong><span>Remote Actions</span></div></div><p style="font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:22px">Troubleshoot remotely. Resolve faster. Reduce onsite intervention.</p></div><div class="cc-screen"><div class="cc-screen-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="cc-screen-body"><div class="cc-live"><img src="assets/Ultima%207%20image.png" alt="Ultima device in CirrusConnect live remote session"/></div><div class="cc-tools"><div class="cc-tool">SCREENSHOT</div><div class="cc-tool">REBOOT</div><div class="cc-tool">APP RESTART</div><div class="cc-tool">DEVICE SETTINGS</div><div class="cc-tool">LOGS</div><div class="cc-tool">APPLICATIONS</div></div></div><div class="cc-actionrail"><span>Live View</span><span>Remote Control</span><span>Record</span><span>Diagnostics</span><span>App Management</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cc-section soft"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="cc-scale"><div><div class="zk-eyebrow">BUILT TO SCALE</div><h2>One Customer or Thousands.<br/>One Clock or an Entire Fleet.</h2><p>Centralize operations across customers, locations and Ultima deployments—while maintaining the visibility and control each environment requires.</p><div class="cc-operate"><div class="cc-op"><strong>DEPLOY</strong><span>Enroll · Configure</span></div><div class="cc-op"><strong>MONITOR</strong><span>Status · Health</span></div><div class="cc-op"><strong>UPDATE</strong><span>Apps · OS</span></div><div class="cc-op"><strong>SUPPORT</strong><span>Remote · Resolve</span></div></div></div><div class="cc-hierarchy"><div class="cc-h-top">SOFTWARE PARTNER</div><div class="cc-h-core">CIRRUSCONNECT</div><div class="cc-customers"><div class="cc-customer">CUSTOMER A<img src="assets/Ultima%205%20G3%20image.png" alt="Ultima 5"/></div><div class="cc-customer">CUSTOMER B<img src="assets/Ultima%207p%20image.png" alt="Ultima 7P"/></div><div class="cc-customer">CUSTOMER C<img src="assets/Ultima%2010%20image.png" alt="Ultima 10"/></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cc-section"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="cc-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">BUILT FOR SOFTWARE PARTNERS</div><h2>Your Platform.<br/>Our Technology Behind the Clock.</h2><p>Extend your software to the Ultima Series without rebuilding the specialized technology required behind the device.</p></div><div class="cc-partner-arch"><div class="cc-archbox"><div class="zk-eyebrow">YOUR EXPERIENCE</div><h3>Your WFM / HCM Platform</h3><p>Application · Workflows · Customer Experience</p></div><div class="cc-arrows">↔<small>APIs</small></div><div class="cc-archbox core"><div class="zk-eyebrow" style="color:#a9d88e">OUR TECHNOLOGY</div><h3>CirrusConnect</h3><p>Connect · Manage · Support · Scale</p></div><div class="cc-arrows">↔<small>EDGE</small></div><div class="cc-archbox"><div class="zk-eyebrow">ULTIMA SERIES</div><h3>Workforce Interaction</h3><p>Devices · TimeTrack · Employees</p></div></div><div class="cc-partner-value"><div class="cc-value"><strong>CONNECT</strong><span>Integrate your platform</span></div><div class="cc-value"><strong>EXTEND</strong><span>Reach the workforce edge</span></div><div class="cc-value"><strong>OPERATE</strong><span>Manage the technology</span></div><div class="cc-value"><strong>SCALE</strong><span>Grow across customers</span></div></div><div class="cc-statement" style="font-size:26px">Build Less. Offer More. Grow Faster.</div></div></section>
<section class="cc-final"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">CIRRUSCONNECT + ULTIMA SERIES</div><h2>Connect. Manage. Support. Scale.</h2><p>One cloud platform connecting your workforce software to the Ultima Series, and the technology to operate it.</p><a class="zk-btn primary" href="contact.html">Request a Demo <span>→</span></a></div></section>
<script is:inline>
  const zohoModal = document.querySelector('[data-zoho-modal]');
  let zohoLastTrigger;
  const closeZohoLeadForm = () => { zohoModal?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true'); document.body.classList.remove('zoho-modal-open'); zohoLastTrigger?.focus(); };
  const openZohoLeadForm = (trigger) => { zohoLastTrigger = trigger; zohoModal?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false'); document.body.classList.add('zoho-modal-open'); zohoModal?.querySelector('#Company')?.focus(); };
  document.querySelector('.cc-final .zk-btn.primary')?.classList.add('zk-standard-bottom-cta');
  document.querySelector('.cc-final .zk-btn.primary')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { event.preventDefault(); openZohoLeadForm(event.currentTarget); });
  zohoModal?.querySelectorAll('[data-zoho-form-close]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', closeZohoLeadForm));
  document.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => { if (event.key === 'Escape' && zohoModal?.getAttribute('aria-hidden') === 'false') closeZohoLeadForm(); });
  zohoModal?.querySelector('[data-zoho-captcha-reload]')?.addEventListener('click', () => { const captcha = document.getElementById('imgid4421205000000933108'); captcha.src = captcha.src.replace(/&d\d+$/, '') + '&d' + Date.now(); });
  zohoModal?.querySelector('form')?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => { const form = event.currentTarget; if (!form.checkValidity()) { event.preventDefault(); form.reportValidity(); return; } form.querySelector('.formsubmit')?.setAttribute('disabled', 'disabled'); });
  window.checkMandatory4421205000000933108 = () => { const form = document.forms.WebToLeads4421205000000933108; if (!form?.checkValidity()) { form?.reportValidity(); return false; } form.querySelector('.formsubmit')?.setAttribute('disabled', 'disabled'); return true; };
</script>
